.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c, charge +1, optimisation and frequencies of the protomer with the proton on the ring nitrogen (conformer 1 of the CREST step). This calculation shows the protomer that forms: the amino lone pair stays in resonance with the ring and the positive charge is shared between the two nitrogens.
